      "head": "{\"kind\":\"artifact\",\"artifact\":{\"title\":\"Stochastic Gradient Descent on a Loss Bowl: Learning Rate and Batch Size\",\"description\":\"A blue bowl-shaped surface shows the loss for two model settings. It is steep left to right and gentle front to back. A red ball marks the current settings. Each step moves the ball by learning rate times a noisy slope estimate. An orange trail marks every step, up to 40. A purple arrow shows the mini-batch step and a dark arrow shows the step the full data would give. A faded blue ghost can keep the last run so you can compare it with the next one.\",\"experience\":\"experiment\",\"behavior\":\"rules\",\"controlProfile\":\"inspect\",\"stepped\":true,\"scene\":{\"materials\":[{\"id\":\"bowlM\",\"color\":\"#8fa8c8\"},{\"id\":\"ballM\",\"color\":\"#d23c2a\"},{\"id\":\"trailM\",\"color\":\"#e8731a\"},{\"id\":\"ghostM\",\"color\":\"#1f3a7a\"},{\"id\":\"stepM\",\"color\":\"#7b2fbf\"},{\"id\":\"fullM\",\"color\":\"#2f3640\"}],\"geometries\":[{\"id\":\"bowlG\",\"kind\":\"surface\",\"width\":4,\"depth\":4,\"contours\":8,\"heights\":[[2.8,2.4,2.04,1.71,1.42,1.17,0.95,0.77,0.62,0.51,0.44,0.4,0.4,0.44,0.51,0.62,0.77,0.95,1.17,1.42,1.71,2.04,2.4,2.8],[2.73,2.33,1.97,1.64,1.35,1.1,0.88,0.7,0.55,0.44,0.37,0.33,0.33,0.37,0.44,0.55,0.7,0.88,1.1,1.35,1.64,1.97,2.33,2.73],[2.67,2.27,1.91,1.58,1.29,1.04,0.82,0.64,0.49,0.38,0.31,0.27,0.27,0.31,0.38,0.49,0.64,0.82,1.04,1.29,1.58,1.91,2.27,2.67],[2.62,2.22,1.86,1.53,1.24,0.99,0.77,0.59,0.44,0.33,0.26,0.22,0.22,0.26,0.33,0.44,0.59,0.77,0.99,1.24,1.53,1.86,2.22,2.62],[2.57,2.17,1.81,1.48,1.19,0.94,0.72,0.54,0.39,0.28,0.21,0.17,0.17,0.21,0.28,0.39,0.54,0.72,0.94,1.19,1.48,1.81,2.17,2.57],[2.53,2.13,1.77,1.44,1.15,0.9,0.68,0.5,0.35,0.24,0.17,0.13,0.13,0.17,0.24,0.35,0.5,0.68,0.9,1.15,1.44,1.77,2.13,2.53],[2.49,2.09,1.73,1.4,1.11,0.86,0.64,0.46,0.31,0.2,0.13,0.09,0.09,0.13,0.2,0.31,0.46,0.64,0.86,1.11,1.4,1.73,2.09,2.49],[2.46,2.06,1.7,1.37,1.08,0.83,0.61,0.43,0.28,0.17,0.1,0.06,0.06,0.1,